# SEC-ADAPTER-01. A developer's own security-guidance file is local, never Hone
# policy: the tracked adapter is the only repository security-guidance prompt,
# and tests/security/security-guidance-parity.test.ts fails if this is committed.
# Ignored because the delivery sequence starts `git add -A`, which would
# otherwise track it automatically.
.claude/claude-security-guidance.local.md
