# Supabase CLI local workspace state: carries the LINKED project reference
# (project-ref / linked-project.json / pooler-url). MUST stay untracked so a
# checkout never silently re-points the CLI at another project (the staging↔prod
# foot-gun that overwrote the staging link with the production ref).
/supabase/.temp/
